# A whitelist: a new file in resources/kb/ is ignored unless named here. Only the
# 4-page pilot notes (public since 2026-09-02) and our own gold questions are
# allowed; the Statistik corpus lives outside the repo (tools/kb/README.md).
/resources/kb/*
!/resources/kb/hyptest.pdf
!/resources/kb/hyptest.docling.json
!/resources/kb/hyptest.patch.json
!/resources/kb/gold-questions.json
